#. module: gardening
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gardening.welcome_article_body
msgid "Architect"
msgstr "ສະຖາປະນິກ"

#. module: gardening
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gardening.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As the first invoicing step, create a down payment from the sales order.\n"
"                                This will generate the first invoice in the "
"<strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Invoicing</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                app. Then, schedule one or several "
"\"Invoicing Schedule\" activities\n"
"                                on the sales order with the aim to never "
"forget to send an\n"
"                                intermediary invoice in order to sustain "
"your cash flow."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງເງິນມັດຈຳຈາກໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ.\n"
"                                ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນທຳອິດໃນແອັບ <strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການອອກ"
"ໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                . ຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກິດຈະກຳ \"ຕາຕະລາງການຮຽກ"
"ເກັບເງິນ\"\n"
"                                ໃນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ລືມສົ່ງໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ\n"
"                                ຕາມງວດ ເພື່ອຮັກສາກະແສເງິນສົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: gardening
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gardening.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Assign the tasks to the right responsible and easily check the progress\n"
"                                in the Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"ມອບໝາຍໜ້າວຽກໃຫ້ຜູ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າໄດ້ງ່າຍ\n"
"                                ໃນມຸມມອງ Kanban."

#. module: gardening
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gardening.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time, you can create from an opportunity a beautiful and tailor-"
"made                                        quotation that displays the "
"price, the discount, the unit of                                        "
"measure, and the tax of each:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ສວຍງາມ ແລະ ເໝາະສົມກັບລູກຄ້າຈາກໂອກາດໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ ເຊິ່ງສະແດງລາຄາ, ສ່"
"ວນຫຼຸດ, ຫົວໜ່ວຍວັດແທກ, ແລະ ອາກອນຂອງແຕ່ລະອັນ:"

#. module: gardening
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gardening.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Before generating an intermediary invoice in the <strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Invoicing</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                app, freeze the project status in the "
"<strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Project</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                app to get an overview on the progress in "
"terms of:"
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນຕາມງວດໃນແອັບ <strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການອອກ"
"ໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                , ໃຫ້ຢຸດສະຖານະໂຄງການຊົ່ວຄາວໃນແອັບ <strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ໂຄງກາ"
"ນ</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                ເພື່ອເບິ່ງພາບລວມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າກ່ຽວກັບ:"

#. module: gardening
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gardening.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Before starting the project, make sure you have enough stock. The\n"
"                                confirmation of the quotation also triggers "
"the creation of a\n"
"                                delivery in the <strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Purchase</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                app where you can check the stock levels of "
"each needed storable\n"
"                                product."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂຄງການ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີສິນຄ້າໃນສາງພຽງພໍ. ການ\n"
"                                ຢືນຢັນໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຍັງກະຕຸ້ນໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງການ\n"
"                                ຈັດສົ່ງໃນແອັບ <strong>\n"
"                                        <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການຈັດ"
"ຊື້</font>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                                ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບລະດັບສາງຂອງແຕ່ລະສິນຄ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງເກັບຮັກ"
"ສາ\n"
"                                ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

